MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_001: Ah, hello. You may be the answer to a problem I am\ncurrently facing.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_002: Were you aware that there was a stone statue here\nin Dagsion depicting a brave Saraminian warrior?
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_003: <NCA>Tell him you knew.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_004: <NCB>Tell him you didn't know.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_005: <ACA>Impressive. Few people know of it, as it was not\nprominently displayed.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_006: <ACB>I cannot fault you for your ignorance. It was not\nexactly prominently displayed.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_007: During the reign of King Sergio, my queen's father,\nSaramis was dubbed the "Shield of Dagda."
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_008: And to commemorate our valor in battle, Lord Solel\ncommissioned a statue of a brave warrior.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_009: It was a fine statue, and excellently detailed. But a\npack of contemptible villains has stolen it.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_010: The stonework was adorned with a dazzling jewel,\nwhich I believe was their true target.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_011: Her Majesty is furious at this slight upon Saramis's\nhonor. As am I.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_012: The temples are conducting a search, but we have\ntaken our own action to bring the thieves to justice.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_013: My agents have investigated and noticed a suspicious\ngroup lurking at the purification shrine.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m01_014: Would you assist us in striking at them?
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m03_001: There is compensation involved, naturally. I shall\nprepare a suitable reward.
MID_LGV_SCXX_02_m03_002: It is not an easy place to reach, but if you are\ninterested, head to the purification shrine.